{"title": "Philippines School Shooting Leaves Multiple Students Dead", "summary": "A school shooting in the Philippines resulted in the deaths of six children and injuries to seventeen others. The incident occurred at a high school. This marks the third such high-profile school shooting in the Philippines in recent months. Officials confirmed the suspect, a 16-year-old student, also died in the incident. The shooting took place in the southern part of the Philippines.", "summary_points": ["Six children were killed and 17 were injured in a school shooting in the Philippines.", "The suspect, identified as a 16-year-old student, also died.", "The incident occurred at a high school in the southern Philippines.", "This is the third high-profile school shooting in the Philippines in recent months."], "title_hi": "फिलीपींस में स्कूल गोलीबारी में कई छात्र मारे गए", "summary_hi": "फिलीपींस में एक स्कूल गोलीबारी में छह बच्चों की मौत हो गई और सत्रह अन्य घायल हो गए। यह घटना एक हाई स्कूल में हुई। यह हाल के महीनों में फिलीपींस में तीसरी हाई-प्रोफाइल स्कूल गोलीबारी है। अधिकारियों ने पुष्टि की कि संदिग्ध, एक 16 वर्षीय छात्र, भी घटना में मारा गया। गोलीबारी फिलीपींस के दक्षिणी हिस्से में हुई।", "summary_points_hi": ["फिलीपींस में एक स्कूल गोलीबारी में छह बच्चों की मौत हो गई और 17 घायल हो गए।", "संदिग्ध, एक 16 वर्षीय छात्र के रूप में पहचाना गया, भी मारा गया।", "यह घटना दक्षिणी फिलीपींस के एक हाई स्कूल में हुई।", "यह हाल के महीनों में फिलीपींस में तीसरी हाई-प्रोफाइल स्कूल गोलीबारी है।"], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized the death toll of 6 children killed and 17 injured.", "Highlighted that this is the third high-profile school shooting in the Philippines since June 2026."], "center": ["Reported the death of 6 children and 17 injuries.", "Noted that the 16-year-old suspect also died.", "Mentioned this is the third such incident in recent months."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["6 बच्चों के मारे जाने और 17 के घायल होने की मौत के आंकड़े पर जोर दिया।", "इस बात पर प्रकाश डाला कि यह जून 2026 के